    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST DREAMOUT</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562520/extras/10ba34bebeaa14994bc094c9d1d1e5a3.poster.avif?t=1739496560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562520/extras/10ba34bebeaa14994bc094c9d1d1e5a3.webm?t=1739496560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562520/extras/10ba34bebeaa14994bc094c9d1d1e5a3.mp4?t=1739496560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Attempt[42] is a challenging first person puzzle platformer. <br>In order to clear the level, as fast as possible, you have to defy gravity and change the layout of the level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Game Modes:</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li><strong>Time Attack</strong> - Complete the level within the given time.<br>    </li><li><strong>Freerun</strong> - Take all the time you need.</li></ul>",
